{"t":"Rotten Charge (Counter)","s":"rotten-charge-counter-89e47","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Quest_Condition_White_and_Red_X_8c7ce2.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><dl><dd><i>This page is about the counter. For the mechanic with the same name, see <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotten%20Charge\">Rotten Charge</a>.</i></dd></dl>\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Rotten Charge (Counter)</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">13.20.13560<br/>July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotten%20Charge\">Rotten Charge</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Quest Condition White and Red X\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Quest_Condition_White_and_Red_X_8c7ce2.png\" width=\"11\"/></span> The <b>Rotten Charge</b> counter, not to be misunderstood with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotten%20Charge\">mechanic with the same name</a>, is a special counter that shows up near a character's name in the areas of the <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a>. See the quest page for details on how it works in each area of the quest.\n</div>","quests":["rotten-blood-quest"]}